st - simple terminal
--------------------
st is a simple terminal emulator for X which sucks less.


Requirements
------------
In order to build st you need the Xlib header files.


Installation
------------
Edit config.mk to match your local setup (st is installed into
the /usr/local namespace by default).

Afterwards enter the following command to build and install st (if
necessary as root):

    make clean install


Running st
----------
If you did not install st with make clean install, you must compile
the st terminfo entry with the following command:

    tic -sx st.info

See the man page for additional details.

Credits
-------
Based on Aurélien APTEL <aurelien dot aptel at gmail dot com> bt source code.

Local patches (in patches/)
--------------------------
Applied on top of st 0.9.3, in dependency order:
- st-font2-0.8.5.diff (spare fonts, `font2[]`)
- st-externalpipe-0.8.5.diff (`externalpipe`, `st.h:130`)
- st-alpha-20240814-a0274bc.diff (bg opacity, `alpha`, `-A` flag)
- st-dynamic-cursor-color-0.9.diff (OSC 12 / 112 cursor color)
- st-drag-n-drop-0.9.2.diff (Xdnd, `XdndVersion` in `x.c:228`)
- st-scrollback-reflow-standalone-0.9.3.diff (ring-buffer scrollback)
- st-sixel.diff (sixel graphics, `sixel.c`, `sixel_hls.c`)
- st-boxdraw_v2-0.8.5.diff (gapless box/braille rendering, `boxdraw.c`,
  `boxdraw_data.h`; `ATTR_BOXDRAW` moved to bit 12 — upstream bit 11
  collides with sixel's `ATTR_SIXEL`)
- st-undercurl-0.9-20240103.diff (SGR `4:x` styles incl. curly `4:3`,
  SGR 58/59 underline color, `Su` terminfo cap; `ATTR_DIRTYUNDERLINE`
  at bit 15; default style `UNDERCURL_CURLY`)
- st-copyurl-0.9.3.diff (`MODKEY+l` previous URL, `MODKEY+L` next URL;
  highlight + cycle both directions)
- st-keyboard_select-20250816-a1193c1.diff (`TERMMOD+Escape`: keyboard
  move/select/search, `MODE_KBDSELECT` in `win.h`)
- st-newterm-0.9.diff (`TERMMOD+Return`: new st in the shell's cwd via
  `/proc`, double-fork orphan; `FD_CLOEXEC` on pty master)
- st-openclipboard-20220217-0.8.5.diff (`MODKEY+o`: open clipboard via
  `xdg-open`, double-fork; pledge hunk already satisfied)
- st-desktopentry-0.8.5.diff (`st.desktop` + `APPPREFIX` install;
  also added to `dist`)
- st-workingdir-20200317-51e19ea.diff (`-d path` initial cwd; `st.1`
  updated)
- st-bold-is-not-bright-20190127-3be4cf1.diff (bold keeps its color,
  no bright jump)
- st-delkey-20201112-4ef0cbd.diff (Delete sends `\033[3~` in normal mode)
- st-spoiler-20180309-c5ba9c0.diff (same-fg/bg selection stays readable;
  compares pixels, not pointers, so truecolor spoilers work too)
- st-vertcenter-20231003-eb3b894.diff (`win.cyo` glyph offset for
  `chscale > 1`; also applied to undercurl/strike offsets)
- st-visualbell2-basic-2020-05-13-045a0fa.diff (border-flash visual bell,
  `vbelltimeout`/`VBCELL` in config)
- st-ligatures-boxdraw-20251007-0.9.3 (`hb.c`/`hb.h`, HarfBuzz shaping
  per attribute run; `ATTRCMP` ignores `ATTR_WRAP`; cursor redraws its
  old line to restore ligatures; `xdrawcursor`/`xdrawglyphfontspecs`
  take explicit `charlen`; spec buffer 4x)
- st-appsync-20200618-b27a383.diff (synchronized updates BSU/ESU,
  `su_timeout`, `Sync` terminfo cap; autosync part already upstream.
  BSU/ESU checked before sixel in DCS handling)
- st-expected-anysize-0.9.diff

Pre-merge `*.orig` / `*.rej` leftovers are archived in
`attic/patch-rejects/` for reference; they are not used by the build.

Theme
-----
Nord (Polar Night bg `#2E3440`, Snow Storm fg `#ECEFF4`, Frost +
Aurora accents). Defined in `colorname[]` (`config.def.h:112`,
`config.h:111`); `defaultfg/bg/cs` indices unchanged.

Config
------
`config.def.h` is the tracked template, `config.h` is the local build
file (`Makefile:12` copies it when missing). Keep them in sync when
changing defaults; `config.h` is what the compiler sees.

Fonts: primary `JetBrainsMono Nerd Font`, fallbacks `JetBrainsMono Nerd
Font Mono` + `DejaVu Sans Mono` (all verified via `fc-match`). Cell
size is the max across regular/bold/italic variants so variant
overhang never clips against the per-cell Xft clip region.

Build
-----
    make                # default, warning-free
    make warnings       # default build + -Wall -Wextra
    make debug          # -g + -fsanitize=address,undefined
    ./tests/smoke.sh    # clean build, version check, terminfo check

Hot-reload (theme without restart)
----------------------------------
st reads Xresources at startup and re-reads them on `SIGUSR1`:

    # ~/.Xresources (example: Nord)
    st.color0:  #3B4252
    st.color1:  #BF616A
    st.color2:  #A3BE8C
    st.color3:  #EBCB8B
    st.color4:  #81A1C1
    st.color5:  #B48EAD
    st.color6:  #88C0D0
    st.color7:  #E5E9F0
    st.color8:  #4C566A
    st.color9:  #BF616A
    st.color10: #A3BE8C
    st.color11: #EBCB8B
    st.color12: #81A1C1
    st.color13: #B48EAD
    st.color14: #8FBCBB
    st.color15: #ECEFF4
    st.foreground:  #ECEFF4
    st.background:  #2E3440
    st.cursorColor: #D8DEE9
    st.alpha: 0.8
    st.font: JetBrainsMono Nerd Font:pixelsize=12:antialias=true:autohint=true

    xrdb -merge ~/.Xresources   # publish to the X server
    pkill -USR1 st              # reload theme in all running st

Reloadable live: `color0-15`, `foreground` (258), `background` (259),
`cursorColor` (256), `alpha`. `font` applies at startup only (cell
geometry change needs a restart). Colors set via OSC sequences are
reset to the reloaded theme. Implementation: `sigreload` /
`load_xresources` / `reload_theme` in `x.c` (Xrm, no new
dependencies); `colorname` is `char *` (not `const`) to allow
overrides.

Fixes on top of the patches
---------------------------
- `st.h`: type ordering (`Rune`/`Glyph`/`Line`/`TCursor` before `Term`).
- `x.c:228`: `XdndVersion` is `unsigned char` (matches `XChangeProperty`).
- `st.c:treset` / `selscroll`: sixel delete-mark loop belongs in `treset`.
- `x.c:xfinishdraw`: safe image-list deletion (no use-after-free),
  no `GC` leak on empty clips, x-bounds guard.
- `st.c:tresize`: sixel images on both screens are invalidated on resize.
- boxdraw: zero-length-run guards (upstream divides by `len` / overflows
  the curl arc buffer when `len == 0`).
- undercurl: `58;5;N` / `58;2;R;G;B` semicolon forms honored (upstream
  only reads colon form); `38:…`/`48:…` colon forms routed through
  `tdefcolor` via `carg` (upstream would misparse them); `ustyle` /
  `ucolor` initialized to unset in `tnew` / `treset`; underline colors
  bounds-checked and forced opaque on ARGB visuals.
- copyurl: `findlastany`/`findfirstany` made `static`, loop counters
  `size_t` (sign-compare), forward scan with no prior selection starts
  at `term.col - 1` (upstream writes one past `linestr`).
- keyboard-select: `(KeySym)-1/-2` sentinels (sign-compare), explicit
  `/* FALLTHROUGH */`, `(void)` on unused args.
- workingdir: `chdir` guarded by `opt_dir` with error message (upstream
  calls `chdir(NULL)` when the flag is absent).
- spoiler: pixel comparison instead of pointer comparison.
- ligatures: strict-C99 `features`/`NUM_FEATURES` (upstream's empty
  initializer is a GNU extension rejected by `c99`); `size_t` loop
  counters and `(KeySym)`-style casts to hold the `-Wall` baseline;
  `win.cyo` kept in shaped baselines; `hb.h` include guards; extra
  `#include <string.h>`/`<limits.h>` in `hb.c`.
- Config taste (both files, kept in sync): JetBrainsMono Nerd 14px,
  `borderpx = 10`, bar cursor (`cursorshape = 6`), 120x30, full
  `worddelimiters`, `TERMMOD+S` screen-dump to clipboard via xclip.
- Local settings promoted to `config.def.h`: `tabspaces = 4`
  (with matching `it#4` in `st.info`), `alpha = 0.90`.

Wired features (already in tree)
-------------------------------
- Alpha (`alpha`, `-A`), dynamic cursor color (OSC 12/112),
  clipboard (`clipcopy`/`clippaste`, TERMMOD+C/V), `allowwindowops`
  gating (OSC 52, `st.c:2380`).

Trying the new rendering
------------------------
    # box drawing: tmux borders, tree, dialog, or:
    printf '\u250c\u2500\u2510\n\u2502 \u2502\n\u2514\u2500\u2518\n'
    # undercurl + underline color (needs an app or manual SGR):
    printf '\e[4:3mcurly\e[0m \e[58:2:255:0:0m\e[4:3mred curl\e[0m\n'
    # ligatures (needs a ligature font, e.g. Fira Code — none of the
    # currently installed fonts shape any; verified headless via hb):
    printf '-> => != ==> ~~> ||> <|\n'

Shortcuts added
---------------
    TERMMOD+Return   newterm (new st in shell cwd)
    TERMMOD+Escape   keyboard-select (s: select mode, /: search, Enter: keep, Esc: quit)
    MODKEY+l / MODKEY+Shift+L   copyurl previous / next URL
    MODKEY+o         opencopied (open clipboard with xdg-open)
    TERMMOD+S        externalpipe screen dump to clipboard (xclip)

Trying sync (needs an app emitting BSU/ESU, e.g. tmux with Sync cap):
    printf '\eP=1s\e\\...\eP=2s\e\\'  # begin/end synchronized update

Flags added
-----------
    -d path          start in working directory (see st.1)

Future work (not done)
----------------------
- Scrollback search, URL hints, ligatures, emoji width handling,
  zoom persistence — deferred as larger features.

